{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_03",
  "title": "树犹如此",
  "storyCode": "WB-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bb4e52b59317b51b35dd517ec6f5dd7fa25db8700e97af10c152ff28fad56978",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "事没有成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴鸷的山海众成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "text": "两边都有意料之外的高人跟着，没机会下手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "那个年轻秉烛人由他去查，于我们的计划无碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "从龙门来的那个女人不在原本的计划之内，但偏偏找准了方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "她很麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴鸷的山海众成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "text": "我们会继续盯着，再找机会动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "不，经过两次冲突，官府的人想必也会提高警惕，现在开始我们要谨慎行事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "让那个女人多活两日尚可接受，可暴露组织的踪迹，则万万不能允许。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴鸷的山海众成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "text": "是......那接下来，怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "等。先生下一步指令不会太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "“山海八荒，尽归其主。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "身为大地的窃贼而不自知......这里的人们终究会为自己的傲慢付出代价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "时间很近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "你们是在等谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "刺杀朝廷命官，惊扰百姓安生，汝等所作所为，皆视大炎律法如无物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "两个选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "放下兵器，跟我走；要么，我抓你们回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "你被跟踪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴鸷的山海众成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "text": "是刚刚那个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "他反过来跟踪了你。这人武功很高，你无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "但终归是你将这人引到这里的，明白吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴鸷的山海众成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "好，那先解决他，再谈对你的处置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "狂徒，还敢造次？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "夜深了，还没有休息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "以防再发生昨天那样的变故，还是应该多留意点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "宗师这么晚约见我，应该不是为了看风景吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "最后这段时间，难得魏公在，本来确实该好好在这玉门城里走走，看看玉门的风景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "平祟侯的决定，自然有他的考量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "这话或许不该我来说，平祟侯背负的，远远不止玉门这一座城的安危。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "一件事出岔的后果足够严重，“信任”二字就担不起什么分量了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "的确如此。左将军与我共事几十载，靠的也不是“信任”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "望重岳兄体谅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "我又何曾抱怨过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "说起来，还没有和重岳兄好好叙旧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我上次来玉门，还是五年前，再上一次，是十年前，但都很匆忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "而我们上一次见面，还要再往前数......是在京城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "嗯，魏公离京那年，我回去述职，正好在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "没想到重岳兄还记得那么久远的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "魏公不也记得？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "具体是哪一年，我倒真想不起来了。印象里当时也是春天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "晚春。比现在的时节稍微迟一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "当时魏公还是用剑的......不，当时你也还不姓“魏”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "好景千万，武功无数，日子一长，真能留下印象的，也没几个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "但即使现在品评各式武学的时候，也时常会想到赤霄剑法的最后一式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......能在武学上得宗师一句赞扬，我应该荣幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "那天晚上看着是要下雨的，闷热，云压得很低。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "我在城楼上，隔得很远，但仍然看到了驿馆方向的剑光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "一剑之寒，天光乍破。何其凌厉、何其果决的招式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "“云裂之剑，当立则立。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "之后，魏公就出城了吧。那场雨，最后也没有落下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "这倒真是一段久远的陈年旧事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "就是不知宗师现在提起这事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "城楼凭高处，两人的衣袂扬起。\n这本是个无风的晚上。\n目之所及，玉门的房屋和哨楼在夜色中绵延，不见尽头。也只有通过高处的风，才能清楚感知到这座城市正在高速移动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "朝堂诡谲，人心难测，没有人比魏公更懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "但我也相信，一个心中只有权谋伎俩的人，万万使不出那样的剑法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "有一件事，想请魏公帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "宗师亲自开口，不敢不听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "我想请魏公相信玉门一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "魏公和平祟侯一样，肩负的都是炎国一方安宁。要关心操劳的事很多......可是玉门毕竟不同于龙门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "玉门以军事建城，这里的百姓也大都是江湖性情中人。心中多的是热血，少的是筹谋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "可无论如何，大家为国为民，疾恶如仇的心思是不会有错的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我只怕心思单纯的人，遭奸人利用而不自知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "左将军答应的时限，是三日。三日内，定会给魏公一个答复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "在那之前，希望魏公搁置和平祟侯的异见，先不要出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "客随主便，平祟侯让我在这座军营安心等待，我就是有心为他分忧，也实在是无能为力啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "我想起，几日前从龙门来的那位林特使的确算得上精明能干，短短几天的工夫就干净利落地解决了好几件案子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "想来魏公手下这样的人才一定不在少数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......宗师应该是多虑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "太傅也好，平祟侯也好，魏彦吾也好。所谋都不过是为了百姓安生，国家昌盛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我们之间不该有矛盾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "但回首过去，千百年来，人们明明为着同一个目标，最终却闹得不欢而散甚至反目成仇的例子，还少吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "宗师的确有资格说这句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "好，看在宗师的面子上......我答应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重岳",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "text": "多谢魏公。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "天晚了，宗师早些休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......对了，还有件事，好像没和重岳兄提起过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "云裂之剑，并不是赤霄剑法的最后一式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "（压抑的喘息）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "现在，你还可以选择束手就擒。不然下一招，你会再也站不起身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴鸷的山海众成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "text": "（痛苦的呻吟）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "现在只是到腰，再动一下，土块就会埋到你的肩膀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "左边巷子里还藏着三人，右边屋檐上还有两人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "你们两个方才所有行动都是想引出我的破绽，为伏兵创造一个出手的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "但你们不会有机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "我承认，低估了你的实力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "很少见到......源石技艺和武功都这样厉害的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "你不配点评我的武艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "昨日在近卫局林特使回城时出手袭击，今日又跟在她身后意图不轨，早些时候司岁台秉烛人闹市遇刺，多半也是你们所为吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "截杀天灾信使，抢夺数据，山海众究竟在玉门准备着什么阴谋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "你们背后的人又是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "你还是先看看自己背后的人是谁吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "什——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴鸷的山海众成员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "text": "多......多谢先生救命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "给先生添麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "你们不该把时间浪费在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "那个龙门来的女人，已经查到了铸剑坊仓库，是个麻烦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "既然担心麻烦，为什么不去直接解决那个唯一还能左右全局的变数？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "......铸剑坊的老家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "去找到他，最好让那份天灾数据和他一起消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "先生当心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "你不应该还能站起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "text": "休......走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "地面骤然凹陷，像是有生命般地蓄满力气，隆起的土石顷刻间包围了所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "先生，这个人不可小觑——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "寒芒乍现即收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人倒地，土石仍是土石。\n街市静寂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "浪费时间，无聊至极。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "雨霞姐，你怎么去了那么久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "碰巧遇见熟人，打个招呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "你一个龙门人，在玉门的熟人还真不少......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "别闲聊了，我们把各自查到的信息汇总，看能不能发现一些线索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "下午在街边话没说完，你那边有什么进展？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "杜小姐，城南铸剑坊的坊主，是个什么样的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "你是说孟叔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "孟叔是爹当年还在走镖时认识的朋友，武功极高，但是很好说话，整个玉门武行的人都很信任他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "我在玉门人生地不熟，行裕物流能开张也是受了他不少关照......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "这件事和孟叔有什么关系吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "随便问问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "你有话直说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "我一直怀疑现在城里作乱的这伙贼人，是趁着物资跨城补给，从龙门偷渡进的玉门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "直到今天，我顺着走私犯的线索，查到了铸剑坊的仓库。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "所以呢，有什么发现？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "仓库里只有铁坯和锻造用的燃料，那的确是铸剑坊用来囤货的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "蹊跷的是那个看守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "他的脖子上有一圈很奇怪的晒伤。那应该是佩戴特制的防护装备才会留下的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "据我所知，钦天监派出的天灾勘测队伍，长期在荒漠里跋涉，为了防风防晒，通常戴着制式面罩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "那人的晒伤是新伤。而最近玉门钦天监派出的队伍，只有那一支。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "你是想说信使团队在城外的事故有蹊跷，还和孟叔有关联？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "我只是如实向你同步我查到的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "玉门城刚从大漠深处开回来，这里光照剧烈，城中居民晒伤的情况也很常见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "难道凭这点事就要去怀疑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "你们认识这个物件吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "（声音颤抖）......你从哪里找到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "铸剑坊的仓库。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "是我进去查探的时候，在角落捡到的。看起来造型特殊，在一堆燃料铁坯中很显眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "这是“行裕物流”的袖标，是我亲自设计的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "红底的袖箍嵌着金边，还用尚蜀特色的绣工绣着两条流线穿过五芒星的纹样，象征着吉星高照，商路畅通。\n寓意吉祥平安的图案染上了令人不安的赭红，沾染的黄沙也让它看上去斑驳陈旧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "从尚蜀跟着我来玉门创业的年轻人，才会有这个。大小齐出城的时候也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "如果信使队伍在城外出了事，那这件东西根本不该出现在城内！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "大小齐还活着？！那他们为什么要藏起来？不对，是谁挟持了他们不让他们露面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "孟叔？他不是也有四个兄弟在队伍里面......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "怎么回事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "杜小姐，别急，我们冷静分析......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "想不清楚的就别想。我要去铸剑坊问个清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "杜小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "雨霞姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "我刚刚在楼下看到了一个游客打扮的龙门人，是雨霞姐的手下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "他来给你送了东西吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "那个袖标，是当时在城外信使被截杀的现场带回来的证物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "你在利用杜小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "眼下许多线索都指向铸剑坊，试探一下，很有必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "如果那人没有问题，排除一个不太好的可能性，她也安心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "如果铸剑坊真有问题，你这样岂不是将她置于险境？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "如今城内，身处险境的不止她一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "......雨霞姐，我知道你有你的职责，或许一贯如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "我不愿意在这和你争辩对错，我坚决不能认同你的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "我得去帮她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "公子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "怎么回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高大的丰蹄男性躺在病床上，面无血色，健硕的胸膛几乎看不见起伏。\n在左乐的记忆里，太合像是一座山。\n这座山站立在父亲和自己的身旁，不可撼动。\n有什么力量会将山摧折？左乐从未想象过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "就在刚才，太合御史被两名百姓送来军营......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "先告诉我太合叔的情况！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "军、军医说，性命算是保住了......但也只是保住了性命......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "太合御史身上有多处外伤，更严重的是脏器受损，内部大量出血。要是普通人，只怕早就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "太合叔本不该来插手这件事，他是在暗中帮我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "父亲呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "将军正在外城楼镇守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "刚才也通知了将军，将军只回了四个字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门守军",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "text": "“坚守岗位。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......送太合叔回来的人在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "如实说来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "我们看见那位穿着官服的丰蹄老爷倒在路边，我们也不知道发生了什么事，就想着先送到这里来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "城内戒严，你们深夜出游是出于什么目的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "只是睡不着觉，出来走走而已......谁知道一出门就看到有人倒在路边，我们也吓了一跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "你们住在附近，就没有听到什么异动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "没有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "是在哪里发现的伤者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "就在城南边，靠近铸剑坊的小巷里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "铸剑坊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "请问......我可以回去了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "不准。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "你的证言有不详之处，作为证人，还不能离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "啊，这这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "千夫长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "我先行前往，你立刻集结队伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "搜查铸剑坊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "公子......将军的命令是坚守岗位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "父亲命我三日内追剑缉凶，还玉门安宁。以太合御史的武功，在玉门城内受伤，和巨兽信徒脱不了干系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "前往案发地查明真相，捉拿祸首，不正是坚守岗位？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
